# Everything the server writes at run time: the gossip peer list (server.met) and
# the downloaded MaxMind GeoIP database. Operator-supplied inputs (ipfilter.dat,
# misc/enode.sql) and config files deliberately stay in the repo root instead.
data/

# Vendored reference implementation: the original Lugdunum eserver 17.14 binaries, the
# official manual and its Docker rig. ~25 MB of third-party, closed-source,
# non-redistributable material, kept beside the code so tests/interop can build an image
# from it, never committed. The tracked rig that consumes it is tests/interop/, which
# skips itself when this tree is absent. See docs/interop-docker-tests.md.
/lugdunum-eserver/

